  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project are to: (i) provide a reliable, safe and all-weather road linking eastern Botswana to the North-West District including the Okavango Delta; and (ii) reduce road maintenance and vehicle operating costs.</narrative>
